      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Create a character that embodies the polished, refined essence of a high-powered elite, where every feature seems chiseled from the finest marble and every gesture exudes an aura of unyielding authority. The subject's skin should be a flawless, porcelain-like complexion, with high cheekbones and a sharp, angular jawline that speaks to a life of privilege and refinement. Their eyes, a piercing blue, should seem to bore into those they meet, like two icy shards of glass, as if daring anyone to challenge their dominance. A perfectly coiffed, silver-blond haircut should frame their face, with a subtle sheen that hints at expensive hair products and a team of devoted stylists. A delicate, diamond-encrusted watch should be visible on their wrist, as if to remind everyone of their vast wealth and influence. The lighting should be cool and calculating, with soft, golden shadows that accentuate the character's refined features, as if they're basking in the reflected glow of their own opulent surroundings – a lavish, high-rise office suite with floor-to-ceiling windows that offer a breathtaking view of the city skyline, and a private art collection that would make a museum jealous.",
